{
    "title": "Nevermet - VR Dating Metaverse",
    "description": "Want to meet a VR friend or lover on the #1 VR dating app for the metaverse? \r\n\r\nWant a much-needed break from the suffocating limitations of \u2018looks-first\u2019 dating? \r\n\r\nWant to connect soul-to-soul with interesting people from every corner of the earth? \r\n\r\nYou can. With Nevermet. \r\n\r\nSTART CONNECTING TODAY \r\nOn Nevermet, instead of posting content of yourself, you post content of your avatar\u2014no human faces. After creating a profile and setting your age and gender filters, the fun begins. Scroll through potential connections, and if you like someone and they like you back, text to coordinate and meet up for a VR Date. Boom.\r\n\r\n\r\nWORLDS UPON WORLDS UPON WORLDS\r\nIn real life, dating spots are limited. In VR, the possibilities are nearly endless. Common avatar worlds include VRChat, Horizon Worlds, Rec Room, Zepeto, Avakin, and IMVU.\r\n\r\n\r\nTHE FUTURE OF DATING IS VR\r\nVR dating is not a niche fad for a small subset of people. There are fundamental limitations to looks-first, location-dependent dating. Plus, \u2018real-world\u2019 personas, careers, and social statuses are often not even accurate reflections of who we really are. So why should we date based on them?  In VR, you can be completely, totally, and utterly \u2026 yourself. Our mission with Nevermet is to create a brand new digital relationship culture, where people can express themselves freely and where meaningful relationships flourish in the metaverse. We call these \u2026 Limitless Relationships. \r\n\r\n\r\nSAFETY (\ud83d\udc48IMPORTANT)\r\nEstablishing and maintaining the utmost highest standard of safety is what allows Nevermet users to form life-changing relationships with amazing people from every corner of the earth.\r\n+ Nevermet is 18+ and has a service to age-verify our users with their government-issued IDs (find it on the settings page on the \u201cedit profile\u201d tab).\r\n+ Each user\u2019s profile is reviewed and must be manually approved by our moderation team to be accepted into our community\r\n+ You can report users directly in the app, or there are multiple other ways to report on our Discord server and in-app, even anonymously.\r\n\r\n\r\nREADY TO JOIN US? \r\nWhat are you waiting for? Download now. \r\n\r\nSoon enough, dating in the metaverse will be so commonplace that people will hardly be able to conceive of a time when it didn't exist.\r\n\r\nJoin our Discord: https://discord.gg/nevermet\r\nTerms of Use: https://www.nevermet.io/terms",
    "descriptionHTML": "Want to meet a VR friend or lover on the #1 VR dating app for the metaverse? <br><br>Want a much-needed break from the suffocating limitations of \u2018looks-first\u2019 dating? <br><br>Want to connect soul-to-soul with interesting people from every corner of the earth? <br><br>You can. With Nevermet. <br><br>START CONNECTING TODAY <br>On Nevermet, instead of posting content of yourself, you post content of your avatar\u2014no human faces. After creating a profile and setting your age and gender filters, the fun begins. Scroll through potential connections, and if you like someone and they like you back, text to coordinate and meet up for a VR Date. Boom.<br><br><br>WORLDS UPON WORLDS UPON WORLDS<br>In real life, dating spots are limited. In VR, the possibilities are nearly endless. Common avatar worlds include VRChat, Horizon Worlds, Rec Room, Zepeto, Avakin, and IMVU.<br><br><br>THE FUTURE OF DATING IS VR<br>VR dating is not a niche fad for a small subset of people. There are fundamental limitations to looks-first, location-dependent dating. Plus, \u2018real-world\u2019 personas, careers, and social statuses are often not even accurate reflections of who we really are. So why should we date based on them?  In VR, you can be completely, totally, and utterly \u2026 yourself. Our mission with Nevermet is to create a brand new digital relationship culture, where people can express themselves freely and where meaningful relationships flourish in the metaverse. We call these \u2026 Limitless Relationships. <br><br><br>SAFETY (\ud83d\udc48IMPORTANT)<br>Establishing and maintaining the utmost highest standard of safety is what allows Nevermet users to form life-changing relationships with amazing people from every corner of the earth.<br>+ Nevermet is 18+ and has a service to age-verify our users with their government-issued IDs (find it on the settings page on the \u201cedit profile\u201d tab).<br>+ Each user\u2019s profile is reviewed and must be manually approved by our moderation team to be accepted into our community<br>+ You can report users directly in the app, or there are multiple other ways to report on our Discord server and in-app, even anonymously.<br><br><br>READY TO JOIN US? <br>What are you waiting for? Download now. <br><br>Soon enough, dating in the metaverse will be so commonplace that people will hardly be able to conceive of a time when it didn&#39;t exist.<br><br>Join our Discord: https://discord.gg/nevermet<br>Terms of Use: https://www.nevermet.io/terms",
